# The Prankster's area-12 3 (a Progress) against Promotion: First Lieutenant's area-12 5080 (a Progress), both up at
# two entries: a level 1 Warrior in Whitegate, Second Lieutenant completed, AssaultPromotion 25, The Prankster accepted
# at Prog 1 (GMs). Equal ranks play the first container first (file order: Promotion_First_Lieutenant before
# The_Prankster), then rotate; an Event 3 would lose every entry. Area 12: 5080, finished: First Lieutenant begun; a GM
# makes it available again; out and back into area 12: the rotation: 3, finished: The Prankster's Prog 2.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/12
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=27.5,-6,-120 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionLanceCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeantMajor completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionChiefSergeant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSecondLieutenant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.ThePrankster accepted
charvar Quest[6][60]Prog 1
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000                               # past the zone-in lock
walk 27.5,-6,-125                       # area 12: 5080 and 3 tie: 5080 (the first container)
finish                                  # First Lieutenant begun
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionFirstLieutenant available   # a GM
walk 27.5,-6,-120
walk 27.5,-6,-125                       # 5080 and 3 tie again: the rotation: 3
finish                                  # The Prankster's Prog 2
